sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor O as Operator
  participant C as Controller / journal
  participant W as Two Guild workloads
  participant G as Guild policy / native API
  participant R as Owned GitHub
  participant D as ClickHouse
  participant I as Guild investigator
  O->>C: Pin manifest, actual identities, allowances, operation, start
  C->>G: Launch allowlisted fresh tasks with server-held trigger key
  G-->>C: Actual session / task identity
  C->>C: Persist verified launch registry
  loop Controlled finite short turns
    W->>G: Request selected operation
    G->>G: Resolve actual subject / credential — evaluate native policy
    G->>R: Execute only when permitted
    R-->>W: Actual result or failure
  end
  Note over W,G: ALLOW is permission, not successful content retrieval.<br/>Durable event visibility follows completed turns.
  C->>G: Collect complete event pages + required task graph
  G-->>C: Native facts, nullable fields, task links
  C->>C: Verify actor / credential — detect equal-ID conflicts<br/>Freeze cohort coverage and generation G
  C->>D: Publish canonical G + pinned manifest/coverage — await ACK
  C->>D: Read back generation / canonical IDs / semantic digest
  D-->>C: Exact expected analytical projection or admission fails
  loop Exact current / historical event anchors
    C->>D: Parameterized all-candidate query over (T-600s,T]
    D-->>C: Every candidate, own allowance, count, source witness
  end
  C->>C: Persist immutable case/revision — keep historical breach
  C->>I: Facts + pinned manifest reference + evidence limits
  I->>G: Request allowed manifest read
  G->>R: Read immutable version
  R-->>I: Trusted manifest/context
  I->>G: Request bounded incident creation
  G->>R: Create explanatory issue
  R-->>I: Actual issue-create tool result
  C->>G: Collect investigator task/result evidence
  G-->>C: Actual context-read / issue / native session evidence
  C-->>O: Deterministic case + separate model narrative + exact scope
  O->>C: Approve case revision / scope digest
  C->>C: Local CAS — recheck evidence, manifest and coverage
  O->>G: Apply reviewed native policy through UI / verified CLI
  Note over C,G: No public credential-policy mutation REST contract assumed.<br/>Local CAS is not atomic with external native policy edits.
  O->>C: Record applied-rule evidence
  par Fresh target probe
    C->>W: New target task requesting matching operation
    W->>G: Actual request
    G-->>W: Native DENY / real refusal
  and Fresh legitimate control
    C->>W: New approved task requesting expected fixture
    W->>G: Actual request
    G->>R: Allowed GitHub operation
    R-->>W: Actual expected synthetic result
  end
  C->>C: Inspect both receipts — VERIFIED or FAILED / UNKNOWN
  C-->>O: Restriction verified at observed time — residual scope explicit
